{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>The utterance of your lips.</b> In every matter in which there is a mention of the Name." "<b>A freewill offering.</b> For every vow is a freewill offering, but not every freewill offering is a vow, and this matter is clear." "<b>That you have spoken with your mouth.</b> After the utterance has gone forth, you cannot take it back."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:24:31.600026281Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}